            "content": "## ⚠️ Timing\n\nNew Customer records the existing customers on its first poll and emits only customers created later. The Wait (2 minutes) lets the first poll happen before the flow creates the customer. Keep the Wait. The customer is deleted through the ID the trigger emitted, so the cleanup also proves the trigger fired."
